      "solution": "1. Open **Users > Active users**, select **Priya**, and in **Manage settings** set **Usage location** to **United States**.\n2. Open **Billing > Licenses**, select **Microsoft Copilot**, then select **Assign licenses**.\n3. In **Assign licenses**, choose **A group**, select **Copilot Pilot - Sales**, keep **Microsoft Copilot** selected, and select **Assign licenses**. Do not assign to **All users** or **Sales department**.\n4. On **Microsoft Copilot > Assignments**, confirm **Copilot Pilot - Sales** shows **Assigned**; use **Errors & issues** if assignment problems appear.\n5. Open **Copilot > Settings**. Set **Pin Microsoft Copilot Chat** to **Pin Copilot Chat in Microsoft 365 apps (recommended)** and set **Allow web search in Copilot** to **Off**.\n6. Open **Reports > Usage > Microsoft Copilot** to review readiness and usage. Copilot uses Microsoft Graph and semantic index signals within existing permissions; it does not grant extra file access."
